<title>ECUADOR: SOCCER-ECUADOR AND CHILE DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ECUADOR AND CHILE DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador and Chile drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup South American group qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ecuador - Ariel Graziani 44</p>
<p>Chile - Marcelo Salas 53</p>
<p>Attendance 42,000</p>
</text>
